# Supervisor portrait art. Loading cascade (see SupervisorConsole FaceScreen):
#   1. <portraitId>/<expr>_closed.png + <expr>_open.png  — per-expression talk frames
#      (expressions: neutral, stern, pleased, suspicious)
#   2. <portraitId>/base.jpg                             — single static portrait,
#      animated with a brightness talk-pulse + blink dim
#   3. built-in CSS CRT placeholder face
# USE_PLACEHOLDER_FACE in SupervisorConsole.tsx forces (3) for testing.
